Source: pipewire-net-zeroconf
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Maintainer: pipewire-net-zeroconf <maintainer@example.invalid>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13),
               meson (>= 0.59),
               ninja-build,
               pkgconf,
               libpipewire-0.3-dev (>= 0.3.60),
               libspa-0.2-dev,
               libavahi-client-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: pipewire-net-zeroconf-publish
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
         pipewire (>= 0.3.60),
         avahi-daemon
Description: PipeWire mDNS/RTP audio sharing — publish (speaker-host) side
 Native PipeWire module that exposes local audio sinks (and optionally
 sources) on the LAN via Avahi/mDNS under the _pipewire-rtp._udp service
 type. Remote machines running pipewire-net-zeroconf-discover will see
 each local card as a virtual sink they can play into.
 .
 Loaded by /usr/share/pipewire/pipewire.conf.d/30-net-zeroconf-publish.conf.
 .
 Install this package on machines that own audio hardware (speakers,
 amplifier inputs, USB DACs).

Package: pipewire-net-zeroconf-discover
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
         pipewire (>= 0.3.60),
         avahi-daemon
Description: PipeWire mDNS/RTP audio sharing — discover (app-host) side
 Native PipeWire module that browses Avahi for LAN peers publishing
 _pipewire-rtp._udp services and instantiates a local virtual Audio/Sink
 (or Audio/Source) per remote card, with stable node names so per-app
 routing survives reconnect.
 .
 Loaded by /usr/share/pipewire/pipewire.conf.d/31-net-zeroconf-discover.conf.
 .
 Install this package on machines that run applications producing audio
 (web browsers, music players) which should be playable on remote
 speakers.

Package: pipewire-net-zeroconf
Architecture: all
Depends: pipewire-net-zeroconf-publish (= ${binary:Version}),
         pipewire-net-zeroconf-discover (= ${binary:Version})
Description: PipeWire mDNS/RTP audio sharing — both sides (metapackage)
 Convenience metapackage that installs both pipewire-net-zeroconf-publish
 and pipewire-net-zeroconf-discover. Use when a single host should both
 share its own audio and consume LAN peers' audio.
